<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/14/eng@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 30. New section 30A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/14/eng@> .
